CreateApprovalRequest.description:
POST /api/v1/publish-approvals — request that an entity be published.

The server computes the readiness envelope and creates a pending approval;
it never publishes. A human approves it later.

PlanSourceInput.description:
Optional provenance for the tree being planned (echoed back in the plan).

In the full flow #550's deploy API resolves a Git ref → tree and passes this;
a directly-posted tree may omit it (a sensible default is filled in).

StartConversationRequest.description:
Start a Builder-team conversation (epic #593, S7/S8).

``target_workflow_id`` binds the chat to a workflow the user is editing;
``message`` is an optional opening turn.
